### Teste da Rota Raíz
GET http://localhost:3000/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 1. Cadastrar Cliente 
POST http://localhost:3000/cliente
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Carlos",
  "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
  "senha": "abc",
  "cpf": "12345678901",
  "telefone": "4899999999"
}

####
###Fazer Login com Marcos (Armazena o token automaticamente)

# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "carlos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "abc"
}

###

### 2. Listar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Consultar Clientes
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Listar Clientes
DELETE  http://localhost:3000/cliente/2
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json



###

### 3. Cadastrar Console
POST http://localhost:3000/console
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "modelo": "PlayStation 5",
  "marca": "Sony",
  "numeroSerie": "2",
  "tipo": "Mídia Digital",
  "idCliente": 1
}

### 2. Listar Consoles
GET http://localhost:3000/consoles
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Consultar Console por número de série
GET http://localhost:3000/console/2
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. Cadastrar Agendamento
POST http://localhost:3000/agendamento
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": "2026-11-10",
  "hora": "14:30:00",
  "idCliente": 1,
  "idConsole": 1
}

### 2. Listar Agendamentos
GET http://localhost:3000/agendamentos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### Atualizar Agendamento  
PUT http://localhost:3000/agendamento/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "data": "2026-10-30",
    "hora": "15:30:00"
}